<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>UserCheck — Account Lookup</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/lab.css">
</head>
<body data-theme="injection">
<div class="lab-topbar"><a class="lab-back" href="/challenges">&larr; ZeroDay Academy</a><span class="name">UserCheck</span><span class="tag">/labs/sqli-time-blind</span></div>
<div class="lab-wrap">
  <div class="lab-card">
    <h1>Account Lookup</h1>
    <p>Check if an account exists. The page returns only a timing measurement.</p>
    <form method="POST" action="/labs/sqli-time-blind/lookup">
      <label>Username</label>
      <input name="username" value="<%= username %>" placeholder="Enter username" autocomplete="off">
      <button type="submit">Look up</button>
    </form>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="lab-alert error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
    <% if (elapsedMs !== null) { %>
      <div class="lab-alert info">Request completed in <%= elapsedMs %>ms.</div>
    <% } %>
  </div>

  <div class="lab-card">
    <h2>Time-based extraction</h2>
    <p>The username is concatenated into <code>SELECT id FROM sqli_accounts WHERE username = '&lt;input&gt;'</code>. Inject a conditional <code>sleep(ms)</code> call to turn response time into a boolean oracle, extract <code>time-flag</code> from <code>sqli_secrets</code>, and submit it from the challenge page.</p>
    <pre class="lab-code">admin' AND (SELECT unicode(substr(value,1,1)) FROM sqli_secrets WHERE label='time-flag') &gt; 77 AND sleep(800) --</pre>
  </div>

  <form method="POST" action="/labs/sqli-time-blind/reset"><button type="submit" class="secondary">Reset lab</button></form>
</div>
</body>
</html>
